    "agendaChanges": "At the start of the meeting, Trustee Wells moved to transfer Action Items 8.1, 8.2, 8.3 (second readings of Board Policies 3320, 3516.5, and 5141), and 8.4 (Measure U Addendum for Clifford School) to the consent agenda. Superintendent Baker pulled Consent Item 7.6 (Amendment to Agreement with Maxim Healthcare Staffing) to be brought back at a future meeting. Oral Communication (Item 5) was revisited mid-meeting after a late online speaker card was submitted (between Items 6 and 7, and again after the Empowered Math and Reading Teachers Presentation). Items were otherwise taken up largely in order, with Board and Superintendent Reports (Item 9) occurring before Information items (10.1 and 10.2).",
